# --- secrets and local state (never commit) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/notify.config
**/alerts.log
**/kurt_replies.log
**/.sent/
**/.tg_offset
**/.tg_seen
**/.tg*

# --- dependencies and build output ---
node_modules/
dist/
**/web/dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- run artifacts (the starter writes these; per-build runs/ and reports/ are regenerated) ---
**/runs/
**/reports/

# --- OS / editor ---
.DS_Store
*.log
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- board publisher scratch (temp files before exclusive link) ---
**/board/.tmp/
